  <string name="ta_info_visa_title">Layover with visa %s</string>
  <string name="ta_info_visa_subtitle">Some airports don\'t have a transit zone, meaning that layovers will involve entering the country and you\'ll require a visa.</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_title">Interline booking</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_subtitle">It\'s not one ticket, but several different tickets in one booking, otherwise known as an interline booking. They\'re often cheaper that usual bookings, but there are things to consider:</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_subtitle1">You\'ll have to check in for your connecting flight on the layover, including collecting and rechecking any baggage</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_subtitle2">The layover will involve entering the country – if you require a visa, you\'ll be asked for it at passport control</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_subtitle3">If the layover country isn\'t currently permitting tourists, you may not make your connecting flight</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_subtitle4">If you miss your connecting flight due to your first one being delayed, the airline won\'t compensate your expenses</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_subtitle_5">The terms for refunds and exchanges will most likely be different for each ticket</string>
  <string name="ta_recheck_baggage_last_paragraph">You should probably avoid these tickets if you aren\'t an experienced traveler</string>
  <string name="ta_info_night_transfer_title">Overnight layover %s</string>
  <string name="ta_info_night_transfer_subtitle">You\'ll have to spend money on a hotel or sleep on a park bench. Keep in mind that some airports are closed at night.</string>
  <string name="ta_info_fast_transfer_title">Short layover %s</string>
  <string name="ta_info_fast_transfer_subtitle">Only %s – you\'ll have to hurry:</string>
  <string name="ta_info_fast_transfer_subtitle1">If you\'re traveling with baggage, you\'ll have to collect it and check it in again</string>
  <string name="ta_info_fast_transfer_subtitle2">Unpredictable lines at border control</string>
  <string name="ta_info_fast_transfer_subtitle3">Sometimes terminals can be located far away from each other</string>
  <string name="ta_info_fast_transfer_subtitle4">You may not be on time for your connecting flight if the previous one gets delayed</string>
  <string name="ta_info_airport_change_title">Layover with airport change %s</string>
  <string name="ta_info_airport_change_subtitle">It\'s not difficult, but there are things to consider:</string>
  <string name="ta_info_airport_change_subtitle1">You\'ll have to pay for transport between airports</string>
  <string name="ta_info_airport_change_subtitle2">You\'ll have to collect and recheck your baggage</string>
  <string name="ta_info_airport_change_subtitle3">There\'s a risk of getting stuck in traffic and missing your flight</string>
